ned by New Signers as Authorized by Primary Argument Author(s)","x":353,"y":2305,"w":1609,"h":41},{"text":"Contact Person's Printed Name:","x":352,"y":2373,"w":566,"h":33},{"text":"David McLain","x":364,"y":2448,"w":236,"h":30},{"text":"Arguments will be emailed to the contact person listed here for review before they are printed in the Sample","x":222,"y":2691,"w":2038,"h":42},{"text":"Ballot & Official Voter Information Pamphlets.","x":812,"y":2736,"w":858,"h":42},{"text":"Please complete the reverse slde of this form.","x":810,"y":2807,"w":863,"h":40},{"text":"40 Tower Road, San Mateo, CA 94402","x":868,"y":2863,"w":744,"h":41},{"text":"P 650.312.5222 F 650.312.5348 email registrar@smcacre.gov web www.smcacre.gov","x":387,"y":2916,"w":1710,"h":44}]},{"page":2,"width":2436,"height":3156,"lines":[{"text":"OFFICE OF","x":655,"y":242,"w":243,"h":36},{"text":"ASSESSOR-COUNTY CLERK-","x":653,"y":305,"w":669,"h":48},{"text":"RECORDER & ELECTIONS","x":655,"y":378,"w":589,"h":47},{"text":"COUNTY OF SAN MATEO","x":654,"y":455,"w":544,"h":36},{"text":"MARK CHURCH","x":1702,"y":294,"w":369,"h":44},{"text":"CHIEF ELECTIONS OFFICER &","x":1640,"y":354,"w":494,"h":34},{"text":"ASSESSOR-COUNTY CLERK-RECORDER","x":1565,"y":400,"w":645,"h":35},{"text":"Authorization Form for","x":976,"y":622,"w":577,"h":42},{"text":"Change in Signers of Rebuttal Arguments","x":738,"y":681,"w":1050,"h":53},{"text":"Pursuant to California Elections Code SS9167, 9317 and 9504, the author(s) of the primary","x":276,"y":796,"w":1820,"h":44},{"text":"argument in favor of or against a measure may authorize in writing any other person or persons to","x":274,"y":874,"w":1967,"h":46},{"text":"sign the rebuttal argument.","x":274,"y":955,"w":536,"h":44},{"text":"The undersigned author(s) of the primary argument hereby authorize(s) the following","x":272,"y":1112,"w":1836,"h":45},{"text":"individual(s) to sign (up to five) the rebuttal argument to the primary argument in favor","x":274,"y":1191,"w":1866,"h":4