lng","x":278,"y":369,"w":1853,"h":50},{"text":"is critical. That's why we need Measure V now more thon ever.","x":278,"y":426,"w":1156,"h":48},{"text":"Opponents' claims of unnecessary projects don't hold up. The project list is clear: every project","x":279,"y":526,"w":1754,"h":49},{"text":"serves the same core goals — basic repairs and essential upgrades to protect affordable higher","x":279,"y":578,"w":1730,"h":49},{"text":"education and job training. The opposition should clearly understand this: it's all about our","x":279,"y":633,"w":1673,"h":48},{"text":"children's future.","x":279,"y":690,"w":310,"h":34},{"text":"Here Are the Facts:","x":278,"y":791,"w":390,"h":34},{"text":"•","x":348,"y":1228,"w":15,"h":15},{"text":"No Tax Rate Increase. It's Simply an extension of the current rate.","x":419,"y":890,"w":1263,"h":47},{"text":"State Matching Funds. Measure V brings millions back to San Mateo County that would","x":421,"y":943,"w":1668,"h":47},{"text":"otherwise go elsewhere, stretching local dollars further. 2","x":420,"y":994,"w":1107,"h":53},{"text":"Clear, Transparent Oversight. 1000/0 of Measure V stays local and is reviewed by a","x":420,"y":1051,"w":1564,"h":47},{"text":"citizens' oversight committee, with annual independent audits ensuring all funds are spent 4s","x":420,"y":1105,"w":1703,"h":48},{"text":"37","x":1826,"y":1146,"w":67,"h":40},{"text":"promised — no funds can be taken by the State or Federal Goyernment.","x":418,"y":1159,"w":1344,"h":49},{"text":"Our Campuses Are Over 50 Years Old. Some buildings have never been updated, and","x":420,"y":1212,"w":1634,"h":48},{"text":"they dodt meet modern safety and accessibility codes. They need basic repairs to roofs,","x":419,"y":1266,"w":1612,"h":49},{"text":"plumbing, and electrical systems — plus upgrades tp keep pace with in-demand fields like","x":418,"y":1319,"w":1654,"h":50},{"text":"fire, nursing, engineenng, and skilled trades.","x":420,"y":1374,"w":808,"h":47},{"text":"Trust the facylty and students,at College of San Mateo, Skyline College, and Giada College. Trust","x":275,"y":1475,"w":1820,"h":49},{"text":"the flrefighters and nurses who are trained on these campuses. Trust the small business owners,","x":277,"y":1529,"w":1761,"h":48},{"text":"fiscal watchdogs, and community leaders who've studied the fasts. They all agree: Vo!e Yes on","x":276,"y":1583,"w":1740,"h":49},{"text":"96' Measure V!","x":196,"y":1636,"w":287,"h":48},{"text":"RECEIVED","x":746,"y":1931,"w":299,"h":49},{"text":"AUG 1 8 2026","x":769,"y":2026,"w":262,"h":46}]}]}
